# A three-track loop: loopA -> loopB -> loopC -> loopA.
track loopA
compositeTrack on
parent loopB
shortLabel loop A
longLabel Loop A
type bed 3

track loopB
compositeTrack on
parent loopC
shortLabel loop B
longLabel Loop B
type bed 3

track loopC
compositeTrack on
parent loopA
shortLabel loop C
longLabel Loop C
type bed 3
